================================================================================
PART 2: decision 3 re-priced, in the place it lives
================================================================================

From bench_a17_shared's string-path table, taken in ONE process so the three
validators are separated by interleaved rounds and not by three binaries and R4's
0.240 across-build bar. 5,000 strings of P1.2 per content set.

set           bytes validator raw ns/str chk ns/str     delta    chk/raw
ascii        151989 scalar         6.378     28.119   +21.741 4.393-4.419
ascii        151989 table          6.378     14.494    +8.116 2.265-2.281
ascii        151989 protobuf       6.378     16.356    +9.977 2.560-2.592
latin1       303978 scalar         6.990    117.306  +110.317 16.684-16.991
latin1       303978 table          6.990    112.389  +105.399 15.914-16.155
latin1       303978 protobuf       6.990    138.696  +131.707 19.633-19.998
